[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4952689178","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121290#issuecomment-4952689178","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121290","id":4952689178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJzQKGg","user":{"login":"ivoiv","id":11502345,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTAyMzQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11502345?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv","html_url":"https://github.com/ivoiv","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ivoiv/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-12T20:39:31Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T20:39:31Z","body":"Somewhat besides the issue, you might know what you're doing but this will be one of many problem you'll encounter. \n\nVideo game engines aren't made for the values real scale solar system entails. Even with double precision you'll run into all sorts of edge cases and limitations of various engine functions, tools and algorithms that are laregly undocumented because your use case falls outside reasonable limits they were build on. At those huge distances from 0,0 alot of rendering starts to fall apart.\n\nSimilar video games use a whole bunch of smoke and mirrors, hacks and practical effects to make you feel like things are happening at a real scale, while in truth it's a small fraction of it. Distand objects simply increasing in Scale as the game \"pretends\" you approach them, 10,000m/s is actually 10m/s, but things are really small, etc.\n\nHope you get a solution to your problem and good luck with your game!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4952689178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4959843008","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121290#issuecomment-4959843008","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121290","id":4959843008,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ6EywA","user":{"login":"SilverAlicorn","id":1009549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDk1NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1009549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn","html_url":"https://github.com/SilverAlicorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T15:49:44Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T15:49:44Z","body":"I tried a smoke & mirrors approach at first, but switching to double precision and going full scale solved a lot of issues I was running into (and gave me a lot of stuff \"for free\") so I'd prefer to keep exploring that angle for now. When I was able to reproduce the shadow issue in a minimal project I thought I might have discovered something worth looking into, but I understand if it's a big ask. Thank you for your consideration!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4959843008/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4959852557","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121290#issuecomment-4959852557","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121290","id":4959852557,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ6FYDQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T15:50:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T15:50:47Z","body":"This is absolutely something to look into in itself, there are a few known issues with the double precision builds especially related to rendering","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4959852557/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5643533441","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121290#issuecomment-5643533441","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121290","id":5643533441,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABUGF8gQ","user":{"login":"SilverAlicorn","id":1009549,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDk1NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1009549?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn","html_url":"https://github.com/SilverAlicorn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SilverAlicorn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-12T04:46:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-12T04:46:44Z","body":"Well I did finally figure out what's going on here - I didn't realize the shadow caster was getting frustum culled. So, setting a large custom AABB on the object prevents it from being culled, thus preserving the shadow. Not a bug with the engine after all! Case closed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5643533441/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]